    "A listed route does not mean it is running now. Route 20T operates on Mondays to Fridays except public holidays; route 275R operates on Sundays and public holidays. HK Way does not provide live arrivals on this connection list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列出路线不代表现正提供服务。20T 逢星期一至五服务，公众假期除外；275R 逢星期日及公众假期服务。HK Way 不会在此接驳列表提供实时到站信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
