    "Check NP360's official website for operating hours, prices, cabin options, accessibility and any service changes. No cable-car ETA or live operating status is provided in HK Way." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "营业时间、票价、车厢选择、无障碍安排及服务变更，请查阅昂坪360 官方网站。HK Way 不提供缆车到站时间或实时营运状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "營業時間、票價、車廂選擇、無障礙安排及服務變更，請查閱昂坪360 官方網站。HK Way 不提供纜車到站時間或即時營運狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check operating days, return departures and current fares with NLB. A listed route does not mean a bus is running now." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请向新大屿山巴士确认服务日子、回程班次及最新车费。列出路线不代表现时有巴士行驶。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請向新大嶼山巴士確認服務日子、回程班次及最新車費。列出路線不代表現時有巴士行駛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the departure pier, return sailing and service notices before travelling. No live ferry departures or operating status are provided here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出发前请确认码头、回程班次及服务公告。此页暂不提供即时开航信息或运营状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出發前請確認碼頭、回程班次及服務公告。此頁暫不提供即時開航資訊或營運狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the official websites for opening hours, admission, accessibility, contact details and service notices. HK Way does not reproduce those details here." : {
