    "Duration is a reference, not a live arrival estimate. Fares and sailing times can vary by day, vessel and deck. Where details are not reliably represented in the dataset, use the official information." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "航程时间仅供参考，并非即时到站预测。船费及航程时间可能因日期、船种及船舱而异。数据集未能清楚反映的详情，请查阅官方信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "航程時間僅供參考，並非即時到站預測。船費及航程時間可能因日期、船種及船艙而異。資料集未能清楚反映的詳情，請查閱官方資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
