    "Route data comes from DATA.GOV.HK and the app's open transport dataset. Data rights remain with their respective owners. External websites are independent; HK Way is not affiliated with HKJC or the transport operators." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "路线数据来自 DATA.GOV.HK 及本程序的开放交通数据集，数据权利属各自拥有人所有。外部网站独立运营；HK Way 与香港赛马会及交通运营商并无联系。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "路線資料來自 DATA.GOV.HK 及本程式的開放交通資料集，資料權利屬各自擁有人所有。外部網站獨立營運；HK Way 與香港賽馬會及交通營運商並無聯繫。"
          }
        }
      }
