          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bus list uses the Ngong Ping terminus in the transport dataset. It does not plan the final approach to the attraction." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "巴士列表按交通数据集中的昂坪总站筛选，并不规划前往景点的最后一段路程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "巴士列表按交通數據集中的昂坪總站篩選，並不規劃前往景點的最後一段路程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Central Terminus and sixth-generation trams provide improved wheelchair access. Contact staff for assistance and confirm access at intermediate stops before travelling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中环总站及第六代缆车已改善轮椅通道。如需协助请联络职员，并在出发前确认中途站的无障碍安排。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中環總站及第六代纜車已改善輪椅通道。如需協助請聯絡職員，並在出發前確認中途站的無障礙安排。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current Central–Peng Chau timetable does not identify separate fast and ordinary sailings. All published departures are shown below; check official information for vessel arrangements." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现行中环—坪洲时间表未有分列高速船及普通船班次。下方显示所有已公布班次；船只安排请查阅官方资讯。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現行中環—坪洲時間表未有分列高速船及普通船班次。下方顯示所有已公布班次；船隻安排請查閱官方資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current Central–Sok Kwu Wan timetable does not identify separate fast and ordinary sailings. All published departures are shown below; conditional additional sailings are labelled." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现行中环至索罟湾时间表没有区分快船及普通船。下方显示所有已公布班次；有条件开出的加班航班会附有标签。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現行中環至索罟灣時間表沒有區分快船及普通船。下方顯示所有已公布班次；有條件開出的加班航班會附有標籤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current Central–Yung Shue Wan timetable does not identify separate fast and ordinary sailings. All published departures are shown below; check official information for vessel arrangements." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现行中环至榕树湾时间表没有区分快船及普通船。下方显示所有已公布班次；船只安排请查阅官方资料。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現行中環至榕樹灣時間表沒有區分快船及普通船。下方顯示所有已公布班次；船隻安排請查閱官方資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current Sha Tin connection serves the Sha Tin Racecourse (Penfold Park) stop. Route 60R is a supplementary service; do not assume daily or race-day operation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前的沙田接驳路线停靠沙田马场（彭福公园）站。60R 为辅助服务路线，请勿假设每天或赛马日均有服务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前的沙田接駁路線停靠沙田馬場（彭福公園）站。60R 為輔助服務路線，請勿假設每天或賽馬日均有服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The listed minibus connection serves the Sha Tin Racecourse (Penfold Park) stop. Route 60R is a supplementary service; do not assume daily or race-day operation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列出的小巴接驳路线停靠沙田马场（彭福公园）站。60R 为辅助服务路线，请勿假设每天或赛马日均有服务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列出的小巴接駁路線停靠沙田馬場（彭福公園）站。60R 為輔助服務路線，請勿假設每天或賽馬日均有服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MTR planner ends at Tung Chung station. It does not include the cable-car journey or the route from the station to the terminal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "港铁行程规划以东涌站为终点，不包括缆车行程或由港铁站前往缆车站的路程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "港鐵行程規劃以東涌站為終點，不包括纜車行程或由港鐵站前往纜車站的路程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official page lists Sha Tau Kok clearance services as suspended. Check the latest arrangements before travelling." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "官方网页列明沙头角口岸暂停通关服务。出发前请确认最新安排。"
          }
