            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主題公園路線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are dedicated sightseeing products, not ordinary point-to-point bus recommendations. Check the operator for current fares, departure times, ticket conditions and service changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下为专门观光服务，并非一般点对点巴士建议。请向营办商查阅现行车费、开出时间、车票条款及服务改动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下為專門觀光服務，並非一般點對點巴士建議。請向營辦商查閱現行車費、開出時間、車票條款及服務改動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are ordinary public transport routes that pass useful sightseeing areas. They are not tours, and no attraction visit or view is guaranteed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下是途经合适观光地区的一般公共交通路线，并非旅行团，亦不保证可参观任何景点或欣赏特定景观。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下是途經合適觀光地區的一般公共交通路線，並非旅行團，亦不保證可參觀任何景點或欣賞特定景觀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are selected bus routes serving the Ngong Ping bus terminus, not the cable-car boarding point. Use the official guide for terminal access and check your return service separately." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些精选巴士路线服务昂坪巴士总站，并非缆车上车处。前往缆车站的指引请查阅官方指南，并另行确认回程服务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
